OL,3,C'What do you want us to do?': Maresca
OL,4,Con Manchester City's celebrations
OL,6,FEnzo Maresca has brushed off criticism
OL,7,Fof the way Manchester City celebrated
OL,8,Ftheir victory at Liverpool.
OL,10,FCity triumphed 3-0 at Anfield in their
OL,11,Ffirst match since the club were found
OL,12,Fguilty of breaking the Premier
OL,13,FLeague's financial regulations.
OL,15,FThe manner in which the players
OL,16,Fcelebrated after the game has
OL,17,Fattracted criticism for a perceived
OL,18,Flack of humility in the face of the
OL,19,Fstrong verdict, but Maresca insists
OL,20,Fthey have nothing to apologise for.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/5
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
