PN,36102
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F361A1791901106
OL,3,C'What do you want us to do?': Maresca
OL,4,Con Manchester City's celebrations
OL,6,FThe City manager said: "Criticised for
OL,7,Fwhat?
OL,9,F"We won 3-0 at Anfield. What do you
OL,10,Fwant us to do? Even if it was 1-0, it
OL,11,Fwould be exactly the same.
OL,13,F"We work every day to win games. It's
OL,14,Fthe only thing that we can think about
OL,15,Fand be focused.
OL,17,F"The rest? It's just things from
OL,18,Foutside that we need to deal with, but
OL,19,Fwe were so, so, so happy inside the
OL,20,Fpitch, and you cannot imagine inside
OL,21,Fthe changing room."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/5
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
