PN,36103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F361A1791901106
OL,3,C'What do you want us to do?': Maresca
OL,4,Con Manchester City's celebrations
OL,6,FHe was speaking at a press conference
OL,7,Fto preview Wednesday's Champions
OL,8,FLeague clash against Paris St Germain
OL,9,Fat the Etihad Stadium.
OL,11,FFormer City boss Pep Guardiola is due
OL,12,Fto attend the game in what will be his
OL,13,Ffirst visit to the ground since
OL,14,Fstanding down last summer.
OL,16,FThe Spaniard has said he is keen to
OL,17,Fshow his support for the club amid the
OL,18,Fcurrent storm.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/5
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBNW Eng SportCReg RadioFRewind
FL,362,390,250,120,000,100
PN,36104
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F361A1791901106
OL,3,C'What do you want us to do?': Maresca
OL,4,Con Manchester City's celebrations
OL,6,FMaresca said: "I spoke with Pep after
OL,7,Fthe (Manchester) United game. In case
OL,8,Fhe's coming, it's a nice feeling -
OL,9,Fespecially for him, because this has
OL,10,Fbeen his house for 10 years with what
OL,11,Fhe has done here. It's exciting for
OL,12,Feveryone."
OL,14,FMaresca did not say if Guardiola would
OL,15,Faddress the squad.
OL,17,FHe said: "I don't know his plan, if he
OL,18,Fis coming straight to the stadium or
OL,19,Fthe training ground."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/5
