OL,3,C'What do you want us to do?': Maresca
OL,4,Con Manchester City's celebrations
OL,6,FCity have been found guilty of the
OL,7,Fmajority of more than 100 charges of
OL,8,Fbreaching financial regulations and
OL,9,Ffailing to co-operate with an
OL,10,Finvestigation. They maintain their
OL,11,Finnocence and have appealed against
OL,12,Fthe judgement.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/5
